namesexdata (development)

* brazilian_pols: sex is now read from its label rather than a fixed column,
  whose position differs between general and municipal election files.
  Candidates from the 1998, 2002, 2006, 2010 and 2014 elections are now
  classified (105,144 more), 1,961 names no longer have an NA pr_women, and
  the first candidate of each raw file is no longer dropped.
* Raw TSE files: CPF, titulo eleitoral and e-mail blanked throughout history.
